    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "NumPy provides homogeneous numeric arrays and vectorized computation. pandas provides labeled tables for filtering, grouping, and summarizing data such as CSV files. They are third-party dependencies; plain Python may be simpler for small inputs.\n\n",
      "size": 17
    },
