      "type": "text",
      "text": "PURPOSE AND REAL-WORLD USE\nNumPy offers vectorized operations on typed `ndarray` values; pandas adds labeled `Series` and `DataFrame` tools for tabular analysis. A common workflow loads data, checks types and missing values, then filters and groups it. Large datasets may exceed RAM, so choose dtypes and chunking carefully.\n\n",
